	(text "Output inductor calculations:\nLmin = (Vin_max - Vout) * Vout / Iout * K * Vin_max * f\nVin_max = 9V, Vout = 5V, Iout = 2A, K = 0.3, f = 500kHz\nLmin = ~7.4 uH. Choose nearest available 10 uH\n--------------------------------------------\nOutput capacitor calculations:\nΔVout_esr = K * Iout * ESR = 30 mV max\n⇒ ESR = 0.05 Ω max\n\nΔVout_c = K * Iout / 8 * f * Cout = 30 mV max\n⇒ Cout = 5 uF\n\nCout > 4 * (Ioh - Iol) / f * ΔVout_shoot\nUsing Ioh = 1.5A, Iol = 0.5A, ΔVout_shoot = 250 mV:\nCout > 32 uF\nUsing Cout > 32 uF at 50 mΩ ESR: \nChoose Cout = 2 x 10 uF + 1 x 22 uF at 10V = 42 uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.04 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Segoe UI Symbol")
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7fab502d-d770-4ffa-9081-85e97657b673")
	)
	(text "Comparator voltage at FB = 0.6V typ.\nChoose R1 = 162k, R2 = 22.1k so that\nVfb = 0.6V when Vout = 5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
